  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "結婚講好話（七）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>楊忠憲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">小姐生suí真美麗，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">好家教koh真賢慧，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">piànn掃厝內衫ē洗，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奉待序大真有體。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">出門胡蠅後面tuè，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大陣胡蠅iānn-iānn飛，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">『帥哥』看著目睭juê，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不覺喙瀾滴落地。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh如何過去交陪，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">小姐khiàng跤無tè揣，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人阮pì-sù驚歹勢，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">m̄-koh，mā ài……</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">提出勇氣厚面皮，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">首先胡蠅先拍退，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">beh護花看我一个，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趁機表現ài有禮。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">小姐爸母先奉茶，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">趕緊大椅請tsiūnn坐，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">桌面山珍kah龍蝦，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">助消化水果西瓜。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">飽肚整腸烏龍茶，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">出門無車mā有馬，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">好印象kah有機會，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內暗笑heh heh heh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為……</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">小姐手巾拋落地，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭tshih-tshih歹勢講話，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">眉目傳情m̄是假，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一定beh hōo我機會。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人阮m̄是tshit仔詼，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿伯阿姆tàu講話，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真正飄撇少年家，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有志氣跤踏實地。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拄著困難衝ē過，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">m̄驚風霜落大雪，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風雨khah大頭bē低，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tsit款少年無tè揣。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē看m̄-tio̍h緊kā tuè，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">事業成功錢趁濟，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">金銀珠寶無tè hē，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">家產年年ē加倍。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-thang bē記--得，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">書香世家丈人家。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiW_BVh4w0aKp_5hxkdUet8N0Fwlk7VQYAWjQPMBFHgBS5nc5Ryk7m1guFSLAJkzyvHnfco9j1D8EXNZAxSSmVpu1BzLeICj5xzCsi81zvgrKttG_PhWxQLgzip-n6Wk11gUWpb92WA3lLQ0Ys1AtWDVlGFh97MJAn8U5c7tcEvvYhzY9TyQLPby4nZwBCm/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_31.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiW_BVh4w0aKp_5hxkdUet8N0Fwlk7VQYAWjQPMBFHgBS5nc5Ryk7m1guFSLAJkzyvHnfco9j1D8EXNZAxSSmVpu1BzLeICj5xzCsi81zvgrKttG_PhWxQLgzip-n6Wk11gUWpb92WA3lLQ0Ys1AtWDVlGFh97MJAn8U5c7tcEvvYhzY9TyQLPby4nZwBCm/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8